                "id": "soulful-positivity-infectious-enthusiasm",
                "label": "Radiating Unfeigned Enthusiasm",
                "description": "Genuine, passionate belief in the viability of a project naturally transfers confidence to hesitant stakeholders. Unapologetic enthusiasm acts as an emotional catalyst that turns passive observers into active partners."
